        "## Question 1: Check Positive, Negative, or Zero\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to determine whether a given number is positive, negative, or zero.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`num = -8`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Negative",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Negative\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "num = -8\n",
        "\n",
        "if num > 0:\n",
        "    print(\"Positive\")\n",
        "elif num < 0:\n",
        "    print(\"Negative\")\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"Zero\")\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Question 2: Find the Greatest of Three Numbers\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to find the greatest among three numbers.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`a = 25, b = 42, c = 18`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Greatest number: 42",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Greatest number: 42\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "a = 25\n",
        "b = 42\n",
        "c = 18\n",
        "\n",
        "if a >= b and a >= c:\n",
        "    greatest = a\n",
        "elif b >= a and b >= c:\n",
        "    greatest = b\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    greatest = c\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Greatest number:\", greatest)\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
