        "## Question 3: Check Leap Year\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to check whether a given year is a leap year.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`year = 2024`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Leap Year",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Leap Year\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "year = 2024\n",
        "\n",
        "if (year % 400 == 0) or (year % 4 == 0 and year % 100 != 0):\n",
        "    print(\"Leap Year\")\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"Not a Leap Year\")\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Question 4: Generate a Multiplication Table\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to print the multiplication table of a given number from 1 to 10.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`num = 7`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "7 x 1 = 7\n7 x 2 = 14\n7 x 3 = 21\n7 x 4 = 28\n7 x 5 = 35\n7 x 6 = 42\n7 x 7 = 49\n7 x 8 = 56\n7 x 9 = 63\n7 x 10 = 70",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "7 x 1 = 7\n",
            "7 x 2 = 14\n",
            "7 x 3 = 21\n",
            "7 x 4 = 28\n",
            "7 x 5 = 35\n",
            "7 x 6 = 42\n",
            "7 x 7 = 49\n",
            "7 x 8 = 56\n",
            "7 x 9 = 63\n",
            "7 x 10 = 70\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "num = 7\n",
        "\n",
        "for i in range(1, 11):\n",
        "    print(num, \"x\", i, \"=\", num * i)\n"
      ]
    },
