        "## Question 5: Count Vowels in a String\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to count the number of vowels in a given string.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`text = \"Python Programming\"`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Number of vowels: 4",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Number of vowels: 4\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "text = \"Python Programming\"\n",
        "vowels = \"aeiou\"\n",
        "count = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "for char in text.lower():\n",
        "    if char in vowels:\n",
        "        count += 1\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Number of vowels:\", count)\n"
      ]
