        "## Question 6: Reverse a Number\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to reverse a given number using a while loop.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`num = 12345`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Reversed number: 54321",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Reversed number: 54321\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "num = 12345\n",
        "reverse = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "while num > 0:\n",
        "    digit = num % 10\n",
        "    reverse = reverse * 10 + digit\n",
        "    num //= 10\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Reversed number:\", reverse)\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Question 7: Check Number Palindrome\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to check whether a given number is a palindrome.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`num = 1221`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Palindrome",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Palindrome\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "num = 1221\n",
        "original = num\n",
        "reverse = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "while num > 0:\n",
        "    digit = num % 10\n",
        "    reverse = reverse * 10 + digit\n",
        "    num //= 10\n",
        "\n",
        "if original == reverse:\n",
        "    print(\"Palindrome\")\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"Not a Palindrome\")\n"
      ]
    },
    {
