        "## Question 8: Find the Sum of Digits\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to calculate the sum of all digits in a given number.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`num = 5832`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Sum of digits: 18",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Sum of digits: 18\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "num = 5832\n",
        "total = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "while num > 0:\n",
        "    total += num % 10\n",
        "    num //= 10\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Sum of digits:\", total)\n"
      ]
    },
