        "## Question 9: Print Prime Numbers in a Range\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to print all prime numbers between 10 and 30.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`Range: 10 to 30`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "11 13 17 19 23 29",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "11 13 17 19 23 29\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "for num in range(10, 31):\n",
        "    if num < 2:\n",
        "        continue\n",
        "\n",
        "    is_prime = True\n",
        "\n",
        "    for i in range(2, int(num ** 0.5) + 1):\n",
        "        if num % i == 0:\n",
        "            is_prime = False\n",
        "            break\n",
        "\n",
        "    if is_prime:\n",
        "        print(num, end=\" \")\n"
      ]
    },
    {
