        "## Question 12: Count Character Frequency\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to count the frequency of each character in a string.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`text = \"banana\"`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "{'b': 1, 'a': 3, 'n': 2}",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "{'b': 1, 'a': 3, 'n': 2}\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "text = \"banana\"\n",
        "frequency = {}\n",
        "\n",
        "for char in text:\n",
        "    frequency[char] = frequency.get(char, 0) + 1\n",
        "\n",
        "print(frequency)\n"
      ]
    },
