        "## Question 13: Calculate Student Grade\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Write a Python program to assign a grade based on a student's marks.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`marks = 86`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Marks: 86\nGrade: A",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Marks: 86\n",
            "Grade: A\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "marks = 86\n",
        "\n",
        "if marks >= 90:\n",
        "    grade = \"A+\"\n",
        "elif marks >= 80:\n",
        "    grade = \"A\"\n",
        "elif marks >= 70:\n",
        "    grade = \"B\"\n",
        "elif marks >= 60:\n",
        "    grade = \"C\"\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    grade = \"D\"\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Marks:\", marks)\n",
        "print(\"Grade:\", grade)\n"
      ]
    },
    {
