      "source": [
        "## Question 14: Find Common Elements in Two Lists\n\n",
        "**Problem Statement:** Given two lists, write a Python program to find the elements common to both lists.\n\n",
        "**Example Input:**\n\n",
        "`list1 = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50], list2 = [30, 40, 50, 60, 70]`\n\n",
        "**Expected Output:**\n\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Common elements: [30, 40, 50]",
        "\n```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Common elements: [30, 40, 50]\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "list1 = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]\n",
        "list2 = [30, 40, 50, 60, 70]\n",
        "\n",
        "common = sorted(set(list1) & set(list2))\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Common elements:\", common)\n"
      ]
    },
